<title>USA: First Mississippi merger, spin-off complete.</title>
<headline>First Mississippi merger, spin-off complete.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Mississippi Corp said Tuesday the previuosly announced merger of its fertilizer operations with Mississippi Chemical Corp had been finalized.</p>
<p>The merger, which is tax-free to shareholders, became effective following the December 23 spinoff of First Mississippi's chemicals and non-fertilizer businesses to shareholders, the company said.</p>
